node IMG 11.514 45.206 19.307 4.958 "Wing image\l\l• Standard: tif / tiff / bmp / png / jpg / jpeg\l• Adobe: psd / psb\l• Modern: heic / heif / svg\l• Camera \
RAW: dng / nef / cr2 / cr3 / arw / raf / orf / pef / rw2 / srw / raw\l• Microscopy: czi / nd2 / lif / lsm (→ OME-TIFF)\l" rounded,filled ellipse #c8862a #fde6c4
