node I1 16.458 24.781 6.2354 2.9954 "Step 1: Parse inputs\l\l• Load vein / intervein polys\l• Snap raw landmarks\l• Compute wing outline (union)\l• Estimate \
image_shape\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I2 24.486 24.781 7.9125 4.36 "Step 2: Build skeleton graph\l\l• Rasterize vein polys → vein_mask\l• Boundary smoothing (optional)\l• Skeletonize (RIDGE / \
medial-axis / …)\l• Prune (distance-map / multi-scale)\l• Collinear edge merge\l• Gap bridging — pass 1 / 2 / 3\l• Compute \
median_vein_width_px\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I3 23.5 18.249 7.6313 2.5683 "Step 3: Anchor landmarks\l\l• Snap each landmark to nearest node\l• Junction vs endpoint preference\l• Store snap_distance\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I4 14.639 18.249 6.7458 2.1412 "Step 4: Compute wing axis\l\l• Proximal / distal from landmarks\l• Unit vector + length\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I5 23.5 13.743 7.1521 5.1308 "Step 5: Call veins\l\l• Merge through crossvein junctions\l• Detect costa (margin band)\l• Propagate labels through deg-2\l• \
Extend to distal landmarks\l• Detect L6\l• Detect crossveins (ACV / PCV)\l• Label ectopic veins (EV*)\l• Assign tissue polys (\
buffer vw)\l• h-maxima split of intervein polys\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node I6 14.764 13.743 7.5 2.9954 "Step 6: Call intervein regions\l\l• Buffer vein centerlines\l• Match bounding-vein sets\l• Tie-break by wing-axis position\l• \
Absorb tiny fragments\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node MM 13.083 21.067 11.152 2.5683 "measurementMaker: custom distances\l\l• User-defined landmark-pair distances\l• Augments batch CSV with custom_<label>_um columns\l• \
Fast path: emits CSV without running identifyFeatures\l" rounded,filled box #8c3c8c #f4e6f4
node WR 23.5 7.528 14.991 4.2362 "WingResult\l\l• veins: list[VeinIdentification]\l• intervein_regions: list[InterveinRegion]\l• landmarks, wing_outline, warnings\l• \
